/Title (Imagine a rural consumer who uses mobile data for agricultural market rates and education. If the telecom oligopoly \(Jio and Airtel\) tacitly colludes to raise base tariffs by 15%, the consumer's monthly expense increases. Because the demand for data is inelastic, the consumer does not disconnect but reduces spending in other areas of their household budget.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 294 0 R
/Next 377 0 R
>>
endobj
