/Title (Strategic management in the telecom sector is essential to India's digital economy. Through aggressive initial pricing followed by calculated consolidation, Jio and Airtel have established a value-driven duopoly. For businesses and consumers, these strategies dictate the cost of digital access. The effectiveness of future telecom growth depends on continuous infrastructure investment, credible 5G use-cases, and supportive TRAI regulations.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 296 0 R
/Next 380 0 R
>>
