375 0 obj
<<
/Title (Time lags: Infrastructure investments \(like 5G\) take years to show a return on investment. Supply-side costs: Semiconductor shortages and global hardware costs raise capital expenditure. Uneven effects: Urban users receive 5G benefits much faster than rural users.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 338 0 R
/Next 376 0 R
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Title (Trade-offs: Raising prices to pay off debt can lead to short-term subscriber churn, as seen with Vodafone Idea \(Vi\).)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 338 0 R
/Prev 375 0 R
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Title (Conversely, an urban enterprise user might gladly accept a 20% price hike if it is bundled with enterprise-grade 5G security and IoT capabilities. The final result of a pricing strategy depends on incomes, digital dependence, and competition \(or lack thereof\).)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 294 0 R
/Prev 339 0 R
/Next 340 0 R
>>
